{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0182c65ece99f01a0b021b5c07414a73d446d7b9c264c6adf6d31df9c346d8a3", "ja": "（星梨花の新しい衣装が届いた。楽しく歌えるように\n可愛さを押し出したデザインでお願いした……）", "zh": "（星梨花的新服装送到了。为了让她能开心地歌唱，我拜托设计时突出可爱感……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1001_p", "source_sha256": "be7b052bf522902061cc831eaff5a48f864461059abbbe53594075c4f22ee0ec", "ja": "お疲れさま、星梨花。\nおお！　よく似合ってるじゃないか！", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花。\n哦！这身衣服很适合你嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "4e41d3c83c46ecea6eb0f7314ce8f70f4350c7b636c2eecf5b0c11c1be673e30", "ja": "じ……っ。", "zh": "盯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c93b9e7c235e3aa808f3a81e6b9a1de01b949e392ce5b4c9d6ef0b59f4a2a588", "ja": "星梨花……？　えぇと、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "星梨花……？那个，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "19e7143911e225d4778dec52c640afb1cf8d79c421c58a89ec21b46419f7bce6", "ja": "{$P$}さんに質問です。\nわたしがどんな気持ちか、当ててみてください！", "zh": "向{$P$}先生提问。\n请猜猜看，我现在是什么样的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cf2f824d22e841de4a8fbdb2296b25d941da8ce26f15cf2511f821b8e59cb10c", "ja": "えっ！？　いきなり難しい問題だな……。\nうーん……あれ？", "zh": "诶！？这问题也太难了吧……  \n嗯……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "944bf933b56fe5a2f2093626a60e75231d2e116c82eca6fba370b591d1724c6d", "ja": "ソワソワ……ソワソワ……。", "zh": "坐立不安……坐立不安……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1007_p", "source_sha256": "99214ad1751c9288f122bc16b6a75377cb80c1e81be052b596aa657c4df4944e", "ja": "わかった！　とっても嬉しい気持ちだ！", "zh": "我知道了！是非常开心的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "977f0e3fd7294b1e53a8b5452b5c28abbdc72a6f38dcb3f0272a9f2266ace773", "ja": "わっ、当たっちゃいました！\n難しいと思ったのに……どうしてわかったんですか？", "zh": "哇，竟然猜中了！\n我还以为挺难的呢……您是怎么看出来的呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1009_p", "source_sha256": "18d87b5074fa8da418e72a5528a6e2191c11bc8ef0616aa856e8af5eb6788e35", "ja": "星梨花を見てたらわかるよ。\n嬉しさが隠しきれてなかったからな。", "zh": "看着星梨花就知道了。因为你的开心根本藏不住。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "2e88195e57e09b6331a659476eb62a1532c2e89a45d5c2c82b6ef339c44f0803", "ja": "そうなんですか？　ううっ、隠してたつもりだったのに\n……ちょっと恥ずかしいです。", "zh": "是这样吗？　呜，我还以为自己藏得挺好的……有点不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1011_p", "source_sha256": "84303c7451dfadb2179c0982fdbee7bdf0719bd1214f614c3ae71d7f2a8c6341", "ja": "ははっ。それだけ、星梨花が喜んでくれたんだ。\n頑張って考えた甲斐があるよ。", "zh": "哈哈。看来星梨花真的很开心。\n我费心想了这么多也算值得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "d43fa1ceb986781acb6b87b45ee1570001efaa124704b2cc7bf5850ffdc5bf97", "ja": "あっ……。美咲さんから聞きました！\nわたしが楽しく歌えるような衣装にしてほしいって。", "zh": "啊……我听美咲小姐说了！\n希望把服装做成能让我开心歌唱的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "fe5ea52b916a1579fd35cfe8014442806c7e60a294b300d8f19fe85f72428d0f", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、\nいっぱい悩んでくれたんだよって教えてもらいました。", "zh": "有人告诉我，{$P$}先生为此费了好多心思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "0d19da14f920a5209b20c4107ec7472445e9d4aea462ebef2e1c751874629c68", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いつも忙しいのに……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生明明一直都那么忙……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6f0529dd16fe602ca7b57bd18abf71e142427a4d5de8bd7925f98d2b93e4f9cf", "ja": "気にしなくていいんだよ。星梨花をアイドルとして\n輝かせるのが、プロデューサーの仕事だからな。", "zh": "不用在意。让星梨花作为偶像绽放光彩，就是制作人的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "46e18125cf1f62d98b602f7e6eb0ee8c9333e107b16f4fedf41abb3d0dcddeef", "ja": "アイドルとして……。", "zh": "作为偶像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1017_p", "source_sha256": "21a89dca3e89c4c6c7aeeec1c5dc17a730cd48ad36b75e7a66fc2dd5d2ccc169", "ja": "ん？　星梨花？", "zh": "嗯？星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "bc69e9a443ea5c647f511108d1ace0fe35dc1390cda9fe46b07c90d49367d141", "ja": "それじゃ、この衣装を着て……\n素敵なステージをしたら、お礼になりますか？", "zh": "那么，穿上这套服装……\n再登上精彩的舞台，就算是答谢了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1019_p", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "3a36338ee0e04539dc3d1027918ddba472afddbfe188ee8c5a293a862dce4a4b", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、わたしが素敵な\nアイドルでいられるように、いつも助けてくれます。", "zh": "{$P$}先生为了让我能成为出色的\n偶像，一直在帮助我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "a12f37f64c1bce26d6efb02b8dbc4ab69d3bf1b74b9870ee70680393b1a17a83", "ja": "だからわたしも……\nアイドルらしいお礼がしたいなって思って。", "zh": "所以我也……想用偶像的方式来道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1022_p", "source_sha256": "72cf8092acd8c5358ea5c77a29bbacc0a2559dd163bfbb108a7156feee1aafc6", "ja": "星梨花……。ステージで楽しそうに歌う星梨花を\n見せてくれたら、最高のお返しだよ。", "zh": "星梨花……。只要让我看到你在舞台上开心歌唱的样子，就是给我的最好回礼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "b25808d136f187d9b7d151e720051c1a399c47ec5d423fdd326f3cb2a94e99a7", "ja": "よかったぁ。\nそれじゃあ、今から聴いてもらえますか？", "zh": "太好了。\n那么，现在能请您听我唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1024_p", "source_sha256": "792f9c6877f402239d0cef7d521485c2d2fd28603e0b85739b1878674e8e2b7e", "ja": "えっ？　今から？", "zh": "诶？现在就要？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "79cc486eb1884b1416b58ef9cc8826278371e9cf1b57f14a83b72bd4705a7238", "ja": "はい！　すぐに準備しますから待っててくださいね。\nえっと、美咲さんにお話して……。", "zh": "好！我马上就去准备，请稍等一下哦。\n那个，我先去和美咲小姐说一声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0414_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3e32c3025a4df76775d4e3a8de49f9f9f08fe94477d5f5ac82685d9c1d1b1341", "ja": "いや、準備って何の……。\nおーい、星梨花！　星梨花～！？", "zh": "不是，准备是指什么……\n喂——星梨花！星梨花～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
